{% comment %}
  Product title for the PDP buy box.

  The heading always comes from the product itself, so the block carries no copy
  settings — it exists so the title can be dragged around the buy box like every
  other element.

  Accepts:
  - block {Object} - the title block. Used only for shopify_attributes.
  - product {Object} - the product whose title is shown.

  Usage:
  {% render 'CWC_pdp-title__block', block: block, product: cwc_product %}
{% endcomment %}

<h1 class="cwc_pdp-product__title" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {{- product.title | default: 'Product title' -}}
</h1>
